    ["\n尊贵的市民请注意:  \n敝司以科学精神与公共卫生之名义，\n郑重收购各类啮齿类恶徒\n——无论灰须流寇或黑尾叛党！\n\n<Highlight>*蒸汽动力啮齿类无害化处理箱*</>\n誓将每只阴沟暴君转化为鲁恩王国文明进步的养料！\n\n酬金如下：\n- 完整鼠尾二分之一便士\n- 鲜活样本三便士（附赠镀锡铁皮尊严终结舱） \n\n瘟疫与烦恼，一网打尽！"] = "\nRespected citizens, please note: \nOur company, in the name of scientific spirit and public health,\nsolemnly acquires all kinds of rodent villains\n—whether gray-whiskered bandits or black-tailed rebels!\n\n<Highlight>*Steam-Powered Rodent Neutralization Box*</>\nSwearing to transform every sewer tyrant into nourishment for the civilized progress of the Loen Kingdom!\n\nRewards are as follows:\n- Complete rat tail: 1/2 penny\n- Live specimen: 3 pence (includes a tin-plated Dignity Termination Chamber)\n\nPlagues and troubles, caught in one net!",
